🧠 Optional Improvements

Log ride data to a CSV or JSON file on SPIFFS / SD card.

Add heart rate or cadence input (via ANT+ or BLE).

Implement speed smoothing or GPS correction.

Allow dynamic configuration of rider parameters over BLE or Wi-Fi.

